# Cloudflare DNS → Vercel custom domain
# Production app: https://superadmin.yaadro.ae
# Production API: https://superadmin-api.yaadro.ae
#
# 1) Vercel → Project → Settings → Domains → Add `superadmin.yaadro.ae`
# 2) Cloudflare → DNS → Records (zone yaadro.ae):

# Type   Name          Content                 Proxy status
# CNAME  superadmin    cname.vercel-dns.com    DNS only (grey cloud)

# Why DNS only (grey cloud)?
# - Vercel manages TLS for the custom domain.
# - Orange-cloud often causes SSL / caching issues with Vercel.
#
# Vercel env must proxy API to the LIVE host:
#   API_PROXY_TARGET=https://superadmin-api.yaadro.ae
# Do NOT use superadmin-api.yaadro.online (Cloudflare Tunnel down → HTTP 530).
#
# Remove any old tunnel CNAME for `superadmin` once Vercel is live.
